      "en": "Hex Spell. Strike target foe for 10...50...60 lightning damage. This spell has 25% armor penetration. If you are Overcast, that foe is hexed with Lightning Strike for 3 seconds. When this hex ends, that foe is struck again for 20...36...40 lightning damage.",
